[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0010","text":"《可爱的风啊，可爱的风》……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0020","text":"《可爱的风啊，再去春之国度吧》……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0030","text":"——啊，雾子\n辛苦了——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0040","text":"……旁边，可以坐吗——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0050","text":"嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0060","text":"……你一直在这里练习吗——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0070","text":"与其说是练习……\n……怎么说呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0080","text":"说台词……让我觉得……好开心……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0090","text":"我……\n上次的拍摄……真的真的非常开心……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0100","text":"就像……大家一起……被施了魔法一样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0110","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0120","text":"我们……\n是谁也抓不住的……可爱的风……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0130","text":"嗯……谁也抓不住——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0140","text":"呵呵……\n就算没有服装……没有礼车……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0150","text":"随时……\n都能施下魔法……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0160","text":"用L'Antica的魔法……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0170","text":"“在梦幻的发丝间”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0180","text":"“洒下如魔法般的、恋爱的芬芳”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0190","text":"穿着便服，也能像做梦一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_06_0200","text":"“Magia·L'Antica”"}]
